# The patched Nim toolchain every nelli test run uses: CI's symex-linux leg
# (.github/actions/setup-symex-linux) and the local dev image (scripts/Containerfile)
# both read THIS file, so they cannot silently diverge (a local image with an older Nim
# lacked the 0008 dispatch-table patch and recorded different decline kinds than CI).
#
# The tag is a moving name; the digest is the identity. Bumping the toolchain means
# editing both lines together, then rebuilding the image (scripts/build-dev-image.sh).
# scripts/check-toolchain-parity.sh fails when the image, the CI action, or (with --live)
# the registry tag disagree with the digest below.
NIM_ARTIFACT_PACKAGE=coreyleavitt/nim
NIM_ARTIFACT_TAG=2.2.10-linux-x64
NIM_ARTIFACT_DIGEST=sha256:aacc9dccde71dbd4576216b569c668d5fbf1a3090e56f73992bffb56c59a588c

# The Z3 CI's symex-linux leg installs (.github/actions/setup-z3-linux and setup-symex-linux
# defaults) and the local dev image installs from the same official release zip. The 4.13.4
# row is the Windows legs' version (symex-nightly's z3-4.13.4 leg, scripts/Containerfile.z3-4.13.4).
# check-toolchain-parity.sh fails when any of those copies, or the image, disagree with these.
Z3_VERSION=5.1.0
Z3_ASSET=z3-5.1.0-x64-glibc-2.39
Z3_SHA256=f47be8d27d3230e823bf1eeede2fe0abaca55bb78d0b59974370e6689a92284a
Z3_4134_VERSION=4.13.4
Z3_4134_ASSET=z3-4.13.4-x64-glibc-2.35
Z3_4134_SHA256=93f91f9c6f4a00a041c19fc7a74adc1f441c8244ce70d486e19abcd89c6a014b

# PCRE1 for std/re. The 8.45 row (the final PCRE1 release, interpreter) is the regex model's
# reference: the dev image (scripts/Containerfile) and CI's setup-pcre1-linux build it from
# this tarball. The 8.37 row, built WITH the JIT, is the Windows legs' engine (Nim's
# pcre64.dll): scripts/Containerfile.pcre-8.37-jit builds localhost/nelli-dev:pcre-8.37-jit,
# the local native oracle for the 8.37 JIT model (`scripts/dt-bounded.sh -i pcre-8.37-jit`).
# check-toolchain-parity.sh fails when any copy, or a built image, disagrees with these.
PCRE_VERSION=8.45
PCRE_SHA256=4e6ce03e0336e8b4a3d6c2b70b1c5e18590a5673a98186da90d4f33c23defc09
PCRE_837_VERSION=8.37
PCRE_837_SHA256=19d490a714274a8c4c9d131f651489b8647cdb40a159e9fb7ce17ba99ef992ab
